About the Book

Whatever one meditates and speaks into one’s life sufficiently
enough, certainly becomes one’s experience and reality. There
are few spiritual routines that are as powerful as taking what
God has said concerning your children and brooding over them
in your hearts and declaring them over their lives consistently.

This book harvest scriptures on confessions over children so
that you can appropriate them into their lives. The end result
of this book is that your children will be filled with a rich supply
of the Spirit of God and Spirit of Excellence as a harvest of your
continuous and repeated prophesying of these scriptures into
your children’s lives.

                  About the Author

                                Davids Oluwaseye Ayodele is a trainer,
                                speaker and writer. He is graced with
                                understanding and presenting complex
                                issues with simplicity and clarity for
                                practical application.

He is the founder of several initiatives both within the Church
and the workplace, such as The Wisdom Institute of Leadership
and Ministry for training and equipping ministry leaders,
ENABLED Multiconcept for business and professional leadership
development and consultancy, as well as several other platforms
for Bible-based teaching ministry. He has a bachelor’s degree in
chemical engineering and master’s degree in engineering
management from Ahmadu Bello University, Nigeria. He is
married to Deborah OluwaNifemi and they are blessed with
children.

